Z||000001||RiceCooker||11-29-2000||07:53 PM||||I'll second that<P>I've been a fieroholic for almost two years now and this forum has helped me out plenty. Plus I feel like I have 1600 friends. <P>Even though my car is put away for the Winter, I still visit nearly every day cause I don't want to miss any pics of sweet cars or funny jokes or even the occasional flame war. Thanks to Cliff and everyone else for the best Fiero site in the world!<P>Gotta go I'm late for my FA meeting. (fieroholics anonymous)<BR>See ya there!<BR>||||reg||14
