Z||000005||BAM-BAM||11-30-2000||12:09 AM|||| I CAN FEEL THE LOVE, AMEN!!! Glad that I  could help DAD. That's what this Forum is all about. If you have the info, share it. If you have the part (within reason) give it. If you have the time spare it. I have enjoyed all of this from this Forum and I have tried to be as reciprocal as I can. This comes from a guy that at the begining of the year was going to give his Fiero away.<P> Thak you all who have contibuted to my Fieroholic success, as well as those who will, in the future, contribute. This Forum and you people are why I have fallen in love with these cars (again) and the effort of thier preservation. <P> DAD, may I? Thanks! OK, GROUP HUG EVERYONE!<P> Oh look at that; I have a damn cold in my eye <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>  Peace, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach/KYB Susp.<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats,headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Gauges And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||12
